  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/clQdnxNLP2ndnjv29QDpWY3k_WvuYthQMRK6M1Z6znk.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Using } m=\\frac{f}{u-f} \\\\ & m_1=\\frac{6}{18-6}=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/n9vUnVbL7lEia-bqCv-0NX41Kwr5wWUjnntJ2aptNgY.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\mathrm{m}_2=\\frac{6}{18+6}=\\frac{1}{4} \\quad \\therefore \\frac{\\mathrm{~m}_2}{\\mathrm{~m}_1}=\\frac{1}{2}$",
